                             Benefits of MBFU
     
       ����������������������������������������������������������������
       
       The uniqueness of MBFU is the ability to write full MS-DOS
	   images, and not just transfer files from floppy disks, as many 
	   other utilities do. What's the difference? Other programs often
	   limit themselves to copying the contents of floppy disks to the
	   boot sector of a USB drive. This leads to the system loading only
	   into RAM, all changes are not saved, and after rebooting you get
	   an empty flash drive. MS-DOS BOOT FROM USB, in contrast, provides
	   a full image recording to the disk, ensuring the preservation of
	   all settings and installed programs.


